# Production build (`vite build` → mode=production) — overrides .env.
#
# This must be the publishable key of the SAME Clerk instance the Worker
# verifies against (CLERK_ISSUER in wrangler.jsonc, https://clerk.acgame.win).
# Using the development key here is what broke sign-in before: Clerk signs in
# fine, then every /api call 401s with "Wrong token issuer".
#
# Committed on purpose. The publishable key is public by design (it is just
# base64 of the Frontend API domain and ships in the client bundle); keeping it
# in git is what stops a fresh clone from silently building an unauthenticated
# app. Secrets still never live here.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_Y2xlcmsuYWNnYW1lLndpbiQ
